        "name": "USN-8134-1",
        "description": "It was discovered that pyasn1 could exhaust system resources when attempting to decode a malformed certificate. An attacker could possibly use this to cause a denial of service. (CVE-2026-23490)  Kevin Tu discovered that pyasn1 could exhaust system resources via uncontrolled recursion when attempting to decode malicously-crafted certificates. An attacker could possibly use this to cause a denial of service. (CVE-2026-30922)",
        "aliases": [
          "CVE-2026-23490",
          "CVE-2026-30922"
        ]
      },
